{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_06_end","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_06","title":"舊日碾軋","storyCode":"IS-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"1f3d2124da460ab84cf1d091f8b87ffde0e22f529b0fc3753b20cdad8b5c76f8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"所有的路都已經鋪好，她找上了自己的過去。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"撤退，這傢伙很棘手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不要和她硬來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"守住通往首領的包廂的走道和樓梯口！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，羅塞蒂的人還挺能幹嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要強行突破看起來不太現實啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，德克薩斯這傢伙，明明是在貝斯裡裝了錄音器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彈得還挺像那麼一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正面突破不行的話......那就造一條路出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"別慌張！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"守住這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，這些傢伙，不怕死嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人的情況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通往喬萬娜包廂的各個走道和樓梯口都被守住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的準備很充分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是羅塞蒂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我們從一開始就沒有小看喬萬娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續投入人力，今天，喬萬娜必須留在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們或許沒有小看喬萬娜，但是不是有點太小看我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，早知道今天演的是這樣一齣好戲，我就不費勁去給首領拿酒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜小姐要是對酒感興趣，我這裡倒也有一些好貨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領喜歡敘拉古的許多東西，但唯獨敘拉古的酒，總是喝不慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古的酒，太軟，就和你們揮動武器的力道一樣，讓人提不起勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那或許是你們還沒有喝過敘拉古真正的好酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，這不就是最好的機會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們知道我等這個機會等很久了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝洛內和薩盧佐，讓我嘗嘗吧，敘拉古的好酒，到底是什麼味道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"想從這裡上去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"攔住她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰告訴你，我要上去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，炸藥？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"散開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，那邊的看台塌下來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是——拉普蘭德？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚恐的觀眾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看那邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚恐的觀眾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"難、難道說是家族仇殺......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"她、她竟然把武器藏在樂器裡？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯！"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克薩斯沒有說話，只是看了她一眼，張了張嘴，然後就向樓上衝去。\n空辨認出了她的口型。\n她說：等我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的觀眾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噫——快、快跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦，能天使，空會有危險的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚恐的觀眾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救、救命——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趴下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，老爺爺你好厲害啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看起來很老嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......倒也沒到那個地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，今天上演的，並不是《德克薩斯之死》，而是《羅塞蒂之殤》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，去避難吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......雖然我們也想這麼做，但是，我們的朋友還在舞台上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可舞台周圍已經亂成一團了，我們直接衝過去太危險了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就走後台！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，別攔路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，勇敢的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，老爺爺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後請你吃披薩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，年輕人總是充滿了活力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，你打算怎麼做呢，喬萬娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"首領，各個路口現在都在我們的掌控中，您趁現在離開這裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難得有個能好好觀賞這場好戲的地方，我自然要盡興才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，你果然是她的朋友嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要從那裡上來嗎，切利尼娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，就算有了捷徑，想要到我這裡來，也不會那麼輕鬆的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你認為，我現在逃跑之後，貝洛內和薩盧佐就會放過我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是開戰，親愛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝洛內和薩盧佐無視了西西里夫人的禁令，選擇了對另外一個家族全面開戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳話下去，我們能做的，只有——和他們對抗到底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，敘拉古的好酒，也不過如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥倫比亞雜碎......少得意了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我知道，在你們敘拉古人眼裡，我們這些哥倫比亞家族全都是沒有累積沉澱的暴發戶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥倫比亞那邊這樣的蠢貨確實有許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在所謂的“銃與秩序”之下，你們的血性又剩下多少呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒有小看過敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在看來，至少你們這些人，沒有什麼值得我看重的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦拉赫，劇院那邊出狀況了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"有人把看台炸了下來，切利尼娜直接去三樓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你五秒鐘說遺言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遺言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，哪有什麼遺言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真有這個工夫，幫我和萊昂圖索說一聲抱歉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會用我的方式顧全大局，德米特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂圖索大少爺，我還以為，我們之間能夠愉快相處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從現在開始也不是沒有機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧，大家族出來的人氣度就是不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"騎到我的頭上來了，還告訴我，還有機會挽回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來打個賭吧，瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打賭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈，我的萊昂大少爺，這裡不是宴會場，也不是辦公室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是戰場，我們在這裡只有你死我活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，這是個你會喜歡的賭約。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，羅塞蒂家族的人，真是難纏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官閣下？我們沒有收到你會參與這次行動的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，這不是你能夠介入的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想妨礙你們，現在，我也沒有那個興趣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在找人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在劇院裡很亂，恐怕沒有你要找的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們只要別來妨礙我就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我死在這裡，也和貝洛內家族無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......請便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是這裡的工作人員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"工作人員？工作人員早就被我們趕走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，為什麼他會在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當心，丹——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血液飛濺，有幾滴灑到了拉維妮婭臉上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉普蘭德開闢的“道路”十分有效，還有一小段路，她就可以見到她的老朋友。\n她微微呼出一口氣。\n場面一片混亂，但她知道自己想做什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你果然來了，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在的眼神很好，讓我感覺我像一個獵物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我見識見識你有多大的能耐吧，最後的德克薩斯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......總監閣下，這場混亂......也是演出的一環嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混亂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來，一切都井然有序，盧比奧部長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而接下來，正要漸入佳境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您領導的不愧是沃爾西尼最負盛名的劇團之一，這樣別開生面的劇目我是頭一次見到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，接下來，是中場休息時間，現在，你可以說一說，你想從我這裡獲得什麼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要的東西......不複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇死後，建設部部長的人選一直懸而未決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必您也一直在挑選合適的人選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想說，你就是那個人選？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事實上，我認為沒有比我更合適的人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳，嘔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種時候還有力氣手下留情......真是了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不動手嗎，薩盧佐家的瘋子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不想和一個從一開始就沒打算用全力的傢伙進行無意義的廝殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在等什麼，你在期待什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和人打了一個賭，我希望我賭輸了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"瓦拉赫看向德克薩斯離去的方向，沒有人能阻礙德克薩斯刺殺喬萬娜。\n除了喬萬娜自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"narration","text":"房間內空無一人。\n德克薩斯立刻意識到發生了什麼，然而為時已晚，一把刀架在了她的脖子上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從來到敘拉古之後，我設想過無數種被人刺殺的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯獨沒有想過，會是你走到我的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，居然在這個時候放鬆了警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道以為——只要見到我，我就會抱抱你，說，“切利尼娜，太好了，你真的沒死”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後我們可以坐下喝一杯，聊一聊過去幾年發生的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是來殺你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"narration","text":"這麼說著，喬萬娜卻放下了手中的刀。\n她的臉上笑意盈盈，神情中滿懷思念，像是剛才的殺意只是一個小小的玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，喬萬娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
